com/repos/dotnet/macios/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/deployments","created_at":"2016-04-20T18:24:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T21:01:25Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T20:28:38Z","git_url":"git://github.com/dotnet/macios.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:dotnet/macios.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/macios.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/macios","homepage":"","size":321925,"stargazers_count":2776,"watchers_count":2776,"language":"C#","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":549,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":488,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["csharp","dotnet","ios","macos","tvos","watchos","xamarin"],"visibility":"public","forks":549,"open_issues":488,"watchers":2776,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/pulls/20434","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/macios/pull/20434","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/macios/pull/20434.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/macios/pull/20434.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Addresses #13856 \r\n\r\nThere's a couple of outstanding questions for this PR, so keeping it in draft for now:\r\n1. ~This relies on [System.Net.Security.CertificateHelper](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/main/src/libraries/Common/src/System/Net/Security/CertificateHelper.cs) which is internal. I'm not sure if xamarinios has access to this. If not, should I just copy the file over? It is for instance [used here](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/e705ef5b0c9b03bf10d766a5f00f9965fd6d8b06/src/libraries/System.Net.Http/src/System/Net/Http/HttpClientHandler.cs#L270) to pick the correct certificate in SocketsHttpHandler and HttpClientHandler.~. Update: Imported a copy.\r\n2. I didn't mark [ClientCertificateOptions](https://github.com/dotMorten/xamarin-macios/blob/be5b13fb0c571375de75cfc354a9b596e6af87fd/src/Foundation/NSUrlSessionHandler.cs#L589-L593) supported. However, I rely on it being set to Manual (which is the default).  I also duplicated the [HttpClientHandler behavior](https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/blob/e705ef5b0c9b03bf10d766a5f00f9965fd6d8b06/src/libraries/System.Net.Http/src/System/Net/Http/HttpClientHandler.cs#L286-L292) for requiring Manual to be set, so I'm sort of using a property we say isn't supported, but Automatic would never be supported. \r\n\r\nI also toyed with having a public callback for users to do more native certificate handling, and modeled around the `ServerCertificateCustomValidationCallback` callback:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\n\tpublic Func<HttpRequestMessage, NSUrlAuthenticationChallenge, NSUrlCredential?>? ClientCertificateChallengeCallback\r\n\t{\r\n\t\tget; set;\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\tprivate bool TryInvokeClientCertificateChallengeCallback(HttpRequestMessage request, NSUrlAuthenticationChallenge challenge, [NotNullWhen(true)] out NSUrlCredential? credential)\r\n\t{            \r\n\t\tvar callback = ClientCertificateChallengeCallback;\r\n\t\tcredential = null;\r\n\t\tif (callback is null)\r\n\t\t\treturn false;\r\n\t\tcredential = callback(request, challenge);\r\n\t\treturn credential != null;\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\nThis isn't in the PR, but more than happy to also add that. My thinking was that might enable some scenarios where you can't use the .NET X509 certificates but need to pull native certificate types in","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/issues/20434/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/macios/issues/20434/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]